# LaTeX build artefacts. The PDF is NOT ignored: a delivery note's PDF
# is the record of what the recipient was actually sent, and reading
# the .tex is not the same as reading what was transmitted. Commit the
# PDF of any note that has gone out.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
